War never ends quietly.

2
00:12:16,363 --> 00:12:22,363
Fury is a war, drama, action film directed by David Ayer.

3
00:18:24,545 --> 00:18:30,545
April, 1945.

4
00:24:32,727 --> 00:24:38,727
As the Allies make their final push in the European Theatre, a battle-hardened army sergeant named
Wardaddy commands a Sherman tank and her five-man crew on a deadly mission behind enemy lines.

5
00:30:40,909 --> 00:30:46,909
Outnumbered and outgunned, and with a rookie soldier thrust into their platoon, Wardaddy and his men
face overwhelming odds in their heroic attempts to strike at the heart of Nazi Germany.

6
00:36:49,090 --> 00:36:55,090
Don 'Wardaddy' Collier, played by Brad Pitt.

7
00:42:57,272 --> 00:43:03,272
Boyd 'Bible' Swan, played by Shia LaBeouf.

8
00:49:05,454 --> 00:49:11,454
Norman Ellison, played by Logan Lerman.

9
00:55:13,636 --> 00:55:19,636
Trini 'Gordo' Garcia, played by Michael Peña.

10
01:01:21,818 --> 01:01:27,818
Grady 'Coon-Ass' Travis, played by Jon Bernthal.

11
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
Sergeant Binkowski, played by Jim Parrack.

12
01:13:38,181 --> 01:13:44,181
Fury is a 2014 American epic war film written,
directed, and co-produced by David Ayer.

13
01:19:46,363 --> 01:19:52,363
It stars Brad Pitt with Shia LaBeouf, Logan Lerman, Michael Peña, and Jon Bernthal as members of an American
tank crew fighting in Nazi Germany during the final weeks of the European theater of World War II.

14
01:25:54,545 --> 01:26:00,545
Ayer was influenced by the service of military veterans in his
family and by reading books such as Belton Y.

15
01:32:02,727 --> 01:32:08,727
Cooper's Death Traps, a 1998 memoir that underscores the high casualty rates suffered by
American tank crews in combat against their better-equipped German counterparts.

16
01:38:10,909 --> 01:38:16,909
Production began in England in early September 2013.

17
01:44:19,090 --> 01:44:25,090
Initial filming in Hertfordshire led to the start of principal
photography in Oxfordshire on September 30, 2013.

18
01:50:27,272 --> 01:50:33,272
Filming continued in the city of Oxford and elsewhere
and concluded on November 13, 2013.

19
01:56:35,454 --> 01:56:41,454
Fury was released on October 17, 2014, receiving generally positive
reviews and grossing over $211 million worldwide.

20
02:02:43,636 --> 02:02:49,636
The film explores themes of hero, nazi, ambush, bravery, world war ii.

21
02:08:51,818 --> 02:08:57,818
The tone is dark and emotional.
